    "body": "The CSS Working Group just discussed ``Add target HDR headroom to `CanvasRenderingContext2D ` ``.\n\n<details><summary>The full IRC log of that discussion</summary>\n&lt;annevk> [Not minuting as people can just read the proposal.]<br>\n&lt;annevk> weinig: So this controls the HDR headroom for input into the canvas?<br>\n&lt;annevk> ccameron: Yup.<br>\n&lt;astearns> Sam’s proposal for definitions to spec against: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11307#issuecomment-2718858571<br>\n&lt;annevk> What's color-hdr?<br>\n&lt;astearns> (our draft shortname, but annevk dropped) https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-hdr-1/<br>\n&lt;dholbert> hmm, https://drafts.csswg.org/ is loading slowly today; getting hammered by crawlers or something?<br>\n</details>\n",
